{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"有片｜中俄美元首歷史性舉行三方會晤　國家主席習近平居中主持\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-19-17-16-14AC16FLCJ.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】國家主席習近平、俄羅斯總統普京及美國總統特朗普，今日在深圳麒麟山莊舉行歷史性的中俄美元首三方會晤，並就多項議題進行討論。會議上，習近平居中主持，普京及特朗普則分別坐在兩側。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:55:18.939542+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:15:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:54.924225+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:48:49.918398+00:00","content_hash":"950d114514d686c1e89a51bf5ccb351026c923c95f36e7aa786befe88aadb03e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}